                <mxCell id="t25" value="EMPTY and REFUSED are deliberately different answers. “The filters excluded every row” and “I cannot answer that from this data” are different facts — collapsing them is how a system starts sounding confident about nothing." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=13;" parent="1" vertex="1">
